1
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:40,800
Yun Qingqing,

2
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,680
when you said you wanted
to be my in-game partner,

3
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,080
were you just playing me?

4
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:46,360
I'm innocent, my lord!

5
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:47,920
I really just wanted to be your partner,

6
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,280
do quests, and get the outfits.

7
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,200
Heaven is my witness.

8
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:52,330
I absolutely had no other intentions.

9
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:57,120
But then you got together with Zhang Yi.

10
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:01,920
We even almost got engaged a while ago.

11
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,600
But for some reasons,

12
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:05,120
we've already broken up.

13
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,320
As for what happened back then,

14
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,380
we both had our difficulties.

15
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:14,140
Difficulties?

16
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,039
Yun Huhu,

17
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,440
what difficulties did you have?

18
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:19,160
Do you want me to settle
the score with you?

19
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:19,800
First,

20
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,660
those so-called friends of yours

21
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,000
were all your clients.

22
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,520
You used me to make money.

23
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:25,240
Second,

24
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:27,000
you made me spend ages
finding puzzle pieces,

25
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,560
saying it would grant my wish.

26
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,880
But in the end, you stood me up.

27
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,210
You broke your promise.

28
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,120
Third,

29
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,560
you wouldn't listen to my explanation,

30
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,560
questioned my character,

31
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:36,160
and unilaterally blocked me for no reason.

32
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,090
You were heartless, ungrateful,
and unreasonable.

33
00:01:39,479 --> 00:01:40,280
You're right.

34
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:43,320
But you didn't come to explain it
to me afterward either.

35
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:45,050
You could have used your words.

36
00:01:45,479 --> 00:01:46,280
Yun Qingqing,

37
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,680
don't I have any pride?

38
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:50,320
Was I supposed to eagerly crawl back

39
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:51,680
just to watch you and Zhang Yi...

40
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,400
what was it?

41
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:55,200
"Be together through dusk
and the four seasons"?

42
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,560
Besides, could I even find you?

43
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,729
You were hiding from me like crazy.

44
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,040
Later, I went to study abroad,

45
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,580
staying far away from you.

46
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:05,920
Don't tell me

47
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:08,440
you went to study in Sweden
because of me too.

48
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,560
Someone kept telling me

49
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,880
they loved the auroras and snowfields,

50
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:15,960
and it'd be a waste of life
not to visit Sweden.

51
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,200
I must have been possessed.

52
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,520
I went to Sweden all by myself

53
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,040
just because of her.

54
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,600
I'm sorry.

55
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:28,060
I don't need your apology.

56
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:30,340
I want you to pay your debt.

57
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:32,180
You still owe me a wish.

58
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,050
What do you want?

59
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,320
That was years ago.

60
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,850
Don't take advantage of me.

61
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,000
Don't worry, it's nothing hard.

62
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:45,320
I want to play a puzzle game
with you again.

63
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,960
This time, I'll hide the pieces
and you find them.

64
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,600
When you finish the puzzle,

65
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,160
I'll grant you a wish.

66
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,480
Deal.

67
00:02:58,480 --> 00:02:59,340
It's a promise.

68
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,120
Ms. Shu,

69
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,920
how was your flight experience?

70
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:46,850
Any discomfort?

71
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,400
Like ringing in the ears or dizziness?

72
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:51,880
No, I'm very satisfied.

73
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,240
Glad to hear that.

74
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,780
If you're interested,

75
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:57,140
you can sign up for our official courses.

76
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,440
If I sign up,

77
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:01,180
will you teach me personally?

78
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:04,640
Of course.

79
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,720
Yue Shanchuan,

80
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,840
do you have a sister named Yue Yingying?

81
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,959
Let me be blunt.

82
00:04:20,279 --> 00:04:21,519
How much will it take

83
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:23,250
for your sister to leave my dad?

84
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:25,570
I think you might have misunderstood.

85
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,560
My parents divorced a long time ago.

86
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,240
We didn't grow up together.

87
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:30,720
I haven't seen her in a long time.

88
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,880
I don't care about your relationship.

89
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:35,120
Your sister wants to be my stepmother now.

90
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:37,850
As her brother,
you have to take responsibility.

91
00:04:39,159 --> 00:04:39,920
Ms. Shu,

92
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:41,920
if you're not here to sign up for a class,

93
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,520
I'll take my leave.

94
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,610
I have other students to attend to.

95
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,040
You're a tough one.

96
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:03,040
Rongrong, as a friend for so long,

97
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,720
I still hope to get your blessing.

98
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,760
Did you laugh at yourself

99
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:09,120
when you said that?

100
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,420
You approached me just for my dad.

101
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,840
Don't insult the word 'friend'.

102
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,100
But I just don't get it.

103
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,240
You're educated, talented,

104
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,600
pretty, and young.

105
00:05:18,960 --> 00:05:20,840
Why stoop so low

106
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:23,640
to cling to an old, ugly man?

107
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:25,000
I know you resent me,

108
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,620
but you can't talk about Ye like that.

109
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:29,200
I truly love him.

110
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:30,680
You truly love his money.

111
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:33,560
I love everything about him.

112
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,120
His knowledge, experience,

113
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,080
demeanor, and wealth.

114
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:39,760
It's all these things

115
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,600
that make him who he is.

116
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,320
Rongrong,

117
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:45,760
I was afraid we'd end up like this,

118
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,920
so I never dared to tell you.

119
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,960
Ye and I fell in love at first sight.

120
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:51,520
I know he's your father,

121
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:53,960
so I struggled and backed down.

122
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:56,000
I suppressed my feelings

123
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,600
and didn't dare to cross the line.

124
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,400
For your sake,

125
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,520
I held back so hard.

126
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,120
Then why aren't you holding back now?

127
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:05,850
You should've just kept
holding back for my sake.

128
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,080
Rongrong,

129
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:09,040
holding back won't make love disappear.

130
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,720
It only makes it crazier.

131
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,080
You should know

132
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:18,060
that my parents are separated
but not divorced yet.

133
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:21,120
He said he's already drafted
the divorce papers.

134
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:23,080
He's had enough of being
someone's husband,

135
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:25,240
father, and son.

136
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,720
He wants to be his true self

137
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,280
and be my lover.

138
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:30,800
So I don't expect your blessing,

139
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,640
but please don't hurt or slander our love.

140
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:37,640
I forgot to tell you,

141
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:39,280
I took my mom's last name.

142
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:40,960
So did my dad.

143
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:41,840
So whatever divorce agreement

144
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:42,920
he told you about,

145
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:45,120
he'd never dare show it to my mom.

146
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,560
He's not a good person at all.

147
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,100
You can't outplay him.

148
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,280
I believe he'll become a good man

149
00:06:58,360 --> 00:07:00,120
because he loves me.

150
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,010
Then let's wait and see.

151
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:29,760
Miss, your grilled shrimp is ready.

152
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:30,640
Thanks.

153
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:37,920
You two siblings really are everywhere.

154
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,970
I've been working part-time here.

155
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,020
What are you doing?

156
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:51,240
A tip.

157
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,440
Thanks for your service.

158
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:55,260
I don't need it.

159
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:02,250
I've heard your mom is sick
and you need money.

160
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,320
Why reject my offer?

161
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:05,720
Ms. Shu,

162
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,840
I only earn what I'm capable of.

163
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:14,680
I'm in a bad mood today.

164
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,120
Have a few drinks with me.

165
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,560
1,000 a glass.

166
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,720
That should be within your capabilities,
right?

167
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,980
What do you take me for?

168
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:21,920
Just because you're rich,

169
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,680
does it mean you can
insult people as you please?

170
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:25,340
I can't fulfill your request.

171
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,960
Please stop messing with me.

172
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,340
As for Yue Yingying...

173
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,800
I haven't contacted her for a long time.

174
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,120
Whatever she did out there

175
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:32,799
has nothing to do with me.

176
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,799
You've been blabbering so much.

177
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,799
Are you going to drink or not?

178
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:37,200
You and your sister,

179
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:39,400
one does anything for money,

180
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:41,840
and the other acts
all high and mighty here.

181
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,520
What,

182
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:46,080
is this your family's persona?

183
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:48,530
I'm not acting high and mighty.

184
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:50,330
I just can't hold my liquor.

185
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,620
Let me peel the shrimp for you.

186
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,600
Such a lightweight.

187
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:03,640
Pour the wine.

188
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,240
Feed me.

189
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,040
It's just a sip of wine,

190
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:48,890
yet you're so obedient,
as if I've cast a spell on you.

191
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,920
Then, kiss me.

192
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:32,160
Looking closely,

193
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:35,200
you really are my type.
